<!--
    MO form redesign — SAFE subset shippable from XML.

    Why the user's proposal can't fully land from a data XML:
    The Cabinet Code, Room/Zone, Install Due, MI Status, etc. are
    Studio-class MANUAL fields (state='manual' in ir.model.fields).
    Manual fields live in the DB schema but the Odoo view validator
    (which runs at -u time) doesn't see them on the model class —
    only Python-declared fields. So an XML inherit that places those
    fields fails with:

        Field "x_sbk_cabinet_code" does not exist in model "mrp.production"

    Three paths forward for the manual-field changes:

      (a) Place them via Studio's UI on the live form. Studio writes
          the inherit to the DB directly without going through the
          XML validator. This is the path the original proposal's
          RPC-call route is doing.
      (b) Promote the fields from manual to Python — define them as
          fields.Char/Date/etc on a class _inherit="mrp.production"
          in their owning addon (southbrook_mrp_kitchen_workcenters
          and southbrook_manufacturing_intelligence). They'd then be
          XML-reachable.
      (c) Ship a post-init hook in this addon that creates the
          inherit view rows via ORM (bypasses validation the same
          way Studio does).

    For this commit we ship (a) the always-safe changes — tab rename
    + a new Cabinet Label tab that uses only THIS addon's Python
    fields (sbk_label_*). The header context bar + MI tab from the
    proposal are deferred to Studio or to a follow-up that ports the
    manual fields to Python.

    Two priority bands:

      priority 18 — Tab rename for clarity
                    "Miscellaneous" → "Admin / Locations".

      priority 19 — Cabinet Label tab
                    NEW notebook page with the eight sbk_label_*
                    fields a floor operator wants to see (door
                    name, color, interior, code, hinge, fin, QR
                    URL) and the Print button.
-->
<odoo>

    <record id="view_mrp_production_form_sbk_tab_renames" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">mrp.production.form.sbk_tab_renames</field>
        <field name="model">mrp.production</field>
        <field name="priority">18</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="mrp.mrp_production_form_view"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">

            <xpath expr="//page[@name='miscellaneous']" position="attributes">
                <attribute name="string">Admin / Locations</attribute>
            </xpath>

        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="view_mrp_production_form_sbk_label_tab" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">mrp.production.form.sbk_label_tab</field>
        <field name="model">mrp.production</field>
        <field name="priority">19</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="mrp.mrp_production_form_view"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">

            <xpath expr="//notebook" position="inside">
                <page string="Cabinet Label" name="sbk_label">
                    <group string="Label Data — what prints on the Avery 9421 sticker">
                        <group>
                            <field name="sbk_label_customer_name" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_po_ref" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_tag" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_door_name" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_door_color" readonly="1"/>
                        </group>
                        <group>
                            <field name="sbk_label_interior" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_hinge" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_fin" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_code" readonly="1"/>
                            <field name="sbk_label_qr_url" readonly="1" widget="url"/>
                        </group>
                    </group>
                    <div class="oe_button_box" style="margin-top: 1rem">
                        <button name="action_print_cabinet_label"
                                type="object"
                                string="🏷 Print Cabinet Label"
                                class="oe_highlight"
                                groups="mrp.group_mrp_user"/>
                    </div>
                </page>
            </xpath>

        </field>
    </record>

</odoo>
